+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/BERG> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Granite. Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Ordovician Period (486.9-443.1 Ma BP)."@en .
